  ----
  **Notation.** Solid arrow = request · dashed = response. Dashed red box =
  trust boundary. Amber/red note = defect, unbounded resource or swallowed
  error. Green note = a design decision verified correct. Notes cite ``file:LINE``.
  ----
  **Idempotency scorecard.** DuckDB **YES** (delete-by-Id + insert in one txn,
  watermark last) · Parquet **NO** (fresh uuid file per replay) · LanceDB **NO**
  in the failure direction (index error swallowed, watermark advances anyway) ·
  Salesforce DELETEs **never propagated**. Single-threaded and fully
  synchronous — no ``async`` anywhere in ``syncworker/``.
end legend

